    "description": "Unleash your creativity in this potential-packed duplex, ideally located in the heart of the Inner Richmond District. Each generously-sized unit features 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, a spacious living room, a formal dining room, and is adorned with period details such as a charming fireplace and custom built-ins. Both units share a nearly identical layout. The ground level provides garage parking, a bonus split bathroom, and two versatile bonus roomsperfect for a workshop or gym. The expansive backyard, accessible from every level, awaits your vision. This duplex's prime location just off California Street places you close to Mountain Lake Park, and within easy reach of Clement Street's diverse restaurants, shops, and markets. With Golden Gate Park less than six blocks away and nearby public transportation, you're well-positioned to explore San Francisco's finest offerings."
